                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="project">
                <h3>Product Details Database</h3>
                <p>
                    A database project to store and manage
                    product information using SQL.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="project">
                <h3>Personal Portfolio</h3>
                <p>
                    A personal website to showcase my
                    skills, education and projects.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="contact" id="contact">
        <h2 class="title">Contact Me</h2>
        <p>Thank you for visiting my portfolio!</p>
        <p>Email: your-email@example.com</p>
        <a href="mailto:your-email@example.com" class="btn">
            Email Me
        </a>
    </section>

    <footer>
        <p>© 2026 Dhana | My Portfolio</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
